 "about": "The platform's own way of building, checked end to end on a blank map: five coins are a prefab with a collision trigger and their own graph (walk in: the player's custom variable score goes up, the coin destroys itself); the stall is a prefab with an option tab and its own graph (choose 付一枚币: one coin is taken); the player template holds the variable score and a graph that hears it change; the stage entity only sets the scene and hears things being destroyed. A bar at the top of the screen follows score (the purse). Nothing polls positions. Expect EV_READY, EV_GO, EV_COIN x5, EV_SCORE after each change, EV_GONE x5 on the stage graph, then EV_TAB 1 and EV_PAID at the stall.",
